            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<p>SnapUI 1.1.17: safer updates. Sparkle, which installs them, is now 2.10.1 with its security fixes, SnapUI loads code only from inside itself, and its test links are gone from the app you install. Reopen Last Closed no longer brings back phone shots, and Claude Code is told which screenshots came from your phone.</p>
]]></description>
